      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just found out i have hyperthyroidism like my thyroid is working way too hard. i already take adderall for my adhd though. is it cool to keep taking it? i've been feeling kinda jittery lately and i'm worried it might make my heart go crazy or something",
