      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should talk to them but my doctor is out for like a week and i really need to get my work done. i feel like the jitteriness is just because i'm stressed. can i just take a half dose for now to see if that's better? or maybe i should just skip it for a few days until my thyroid meds kick in? what do u think is the best way to handle it until i can actually see them?",
