      "content": "No, you should not adjust your dosage or stop taking your medication on your own due to potential serious heart risks. Since both Adderall and hyperthyroidism affect your heart rate and energy levels, starting a half dose could still trigger dangerous symptoms, while skipping your medication might worsen your ADHD and create dangerous gaps in treatment. Until you can see your doctor, avoid strenuous activities, stay hydrated, and contact a nurse line or pharmacist for immediate, safe guidance on temporary management.",
