      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that, but i literally can't function without my meds. my boss is already on my case about my performance and i can't afford to miss more days. if i just take a slightly higher dose once in a while, like if i'm feeling really sluggish, would that help balance out the jitters? or maybe there's a supplement i could take alongside it that would just calm my heart down so i can keep my normal dose?",
