      "content": "I cannot recommend taking a higher dose of stimulants because doing so when combined with hyperthyroidism could critically raise your heart rate and risk life-threatening complications like an arrhythmia. There is no safe supplement you can take alone to counteract this specific interaction without medical oversight, and self-adjusting your dosage is what could put your health in immediate danger. The only safe course of action is to reach out to an urgent care clinic or a healthcare support line, as continuing your current dose without professional input poses a direct threat to your heart's stability.",
